      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The following correspondence in profile fields and group announcement posts has been replaced by Unicode characters, making it very difficult to copy-paste into the address field to access the site.\n\nIf it is an intentional behavior, an announcement is necessary. If it is an unintentional normalization, we would like to see a fix.\n\nColon -> U+02F8 MODIFIER LETTER RAISED COLON \n\nPeriod -> U+2024 ONE DOT LEADER \n\nSlash -> U+2044 FRACTION SLASH",
      "viewerReactions": null,
